                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Key Insights</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Month-to-month customers churn at 42.7% vs 11.3% on 1-year and just 2.8% on 2-year contracts.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Customers in their first 12 months churn at 47.7%. That drops to 28.7% in year 2, 20.4% in years 3–4, and just 9.5% for 4+ year customers. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Electronic check payers churn at 45.3% ; nearly 3× the rate of auto-pay customers. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Recommendations</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Offer month-to-month customers a discounted annual contract upgrade</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Build a 90-day new customer onboarding and success program; welcome call at day 3, usage check-in at day 30, proactive support offer at day 60, loyalty reward at day 90</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Migrate electronic check payers to auto-pay with an incentive</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
